# Blackbox Protocol — Environment & Secrets Template
# DO NOT commit real secrets or tokens to source control!

# ── Cloudflare Workers Secrets (set via `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`) ──

# Ingestion Worker (witness-ingestion)
# npx wrangler secret put AUTH_TOKEN --cwd workers/ingestion
AUTH_TOKEN=your-random-secure-bearer-token

# Alert Worker (witness-alert)
# npx wrangler secret put ALERT_SECRET --cwd workers/alert
ALERT_SECRET=your-internal-service-secret
# npx wrangler secret put DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL --cwd workers/alert
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/your/webhook/url
# npx wrangler secret put TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN --cwd workers/alert
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:ABCdefGhIJKlmNoPQRsTUVwxyZ
# npx wrangler secret put TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID --cwd workers/alert
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your-telegram-chat-id
# npx wrangler secret put PLAYBACK_BASE_URL --cwd workers/alert
PLAYBACK_BASE_URL=https://witness-playback.your-subdomain.workers.dev

# ── Web Client (PWA) ──
# Configured directly in the browser via the Settings panel (stored in localStorage):
# - API URL: https://witness-ingestion.your-subdomain.workers.dev
# - Auth Token: (matches AUTH_TOKEN above)
